{"4487380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Breaking Room", "steam_appid": 4487380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Newsletter &amp; First Playable Build</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in active development; you can get the latest news and the first playable build on my website. </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Breaking Room is an incremental game about shattering things with your mind. Start with a coffee cup. End with a skyscraper.</strong> <br><br><i>In the deepest room of the deepest bunker, a research crew is conducting a dangerous study. The patient's ability to focus is so intense that it fractures reality. The group pursues relentless training, pushing the Esper to its breaking point, hoping to harness its power. They don't know what's running in the other rooms…</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls, massive destruction. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/339df5292a97d60ba86265c69d983022.poster.avif?t=1777809539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/339df5292a97d60ba86265c69d983022.webm?t=1777809539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/339df5292a97d60ba86265c69d983022.mp4?t=1777809539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost your telekinetic stats and research powerful compounds. Strategize to find the perfect build that carries you further than the last run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/0afeed6fc39eb1a9b50c579eef0407df.poster.avif?t=1777809539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/0afeed6fc39eb1a9b50c579eef0407df.webm?t=1777809539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/0afeed6fc39eb1a9b50c579eef0407df.mp4?t=1777809539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find secret paths in the deepest bunker and discover all its mysteries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/60ff5acfa6a85d6781815f6b5ea2ab59.poster.avif?t=1777809539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/60ff5acfa6a85d6781815f6b5ea2ab59.webm?t=1777809539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/60ff5acfa6a85d6781815f6b5ea2ab59.mp4?t=1777809539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND ALSO</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push your luck mechanic: Monitor your biometrics and  learn when to stop to get as far as you can.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings and a Prestige system to discover them all.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weird objects to destroy with distinctive behaviors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-chang