rics and  learn when to stop to get as far as you can.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings and a Prestige system to discover them all.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weird objects to destroy with distinctive behaviors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-changing power-ups with spectacular effects.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/1494f82ca643f3e0bbd0c7a2c3d3ae4e.poster.avif?t=1777809539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/1494f82ca643f3e0bbd0c7a2c3d3ae4e.webm?t=1777809539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/extras/1494f82ca643f3e0bbd0c7a2c3d3ae4e.mp4?t=1777809539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Incremental game with physics destruction. Use simple controls to shatter increasingly large environments with your telekinetic abilities. Upgrade your biometrics and research powerful compounds to explore the depths of the breaking room.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/fda7ae453772bfd3bfbe690cfe5cc67d66b28a6a/header.jpg?t=1777809539", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/cb978dd0f3777025ae9cf0b136c46e2060524dcf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777809539", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487380/cb978dd0f3777025ae9cf0b136c46e2060524dcf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777809539", "website": "https://go.designabstract.io/ByK3nTC", "pc_requirements": 